+`APP_ENV`, host `DATABASE_URL`/`REDIS_URL`, `CACHE_KEY_PREFIX`, `CACHE_TTL_SECONDS`,
+`LOG_LEVEL`, `OPENAPI_ENABLED`, `HOST_APP_PORT`, and `FLASK_DEBUG=0`. Values derive
